	001006 Desc             ="16168625, 16196395 and 16197427 PCM with $0E Mask.  This xdf covers all of the original applications of the code. It doesn't cover any code modifications or hardware modifications, with the one exception of code modification to allow Desired AFR dataloging in the place of Battery Volts."
