	030010 Desc             ="Title: Alternate Synchronous Double Fire\r\n\r\nLocation: 400C-Bit 3\r\n\r\nUsage: Air Fuel Mode Words \r\n\r\nTips: Checkmark to enable ASDF. I4 bins are normally on. V6 and V8 bins are normally off.\r\n"
