	030010 Desc             ="Title: Open Loop AFR Enable\r\n\r\nLocation: 400D-Bit 0\r\n\r\nUsage: Air Fuel Mode Words \r\n\r\nTips: Enables use of L4BBC \"Open Loop AFR vs. Temperature vs. Vacuum\" table for closed loop fueling, when coolant temperature less than L48CF \"Maximum Temperature for AFR Lookup in Closed Loop\". Can be used for a \"lean cruise\" or other specific fueling conditions. Also used for VE tuning.\r\n"
