	040010 Desc             ="Title: Choke AFR Decay Time vs. Temperature\r\n\r\nLocation: 4C42\r\n\r\nUsage: Open Loop Parameters\r\n\r\nTips: After startup AFR increases with time, simulation a choke and choke pull off. Time between increments is from L4C42 \"Choke AFR Decay Time vs. Temperature\" X L4C53 \"Choke AFR Decay Time Multiplier vs. Airflow\". AFR is subtracted out to enrich the initial AFR after startup.\r\n\r\nConversion: Sec. = 0.2 * X\r\n"
